## Universal Robots UR5e description

Copied from `ur_description`, part of ROS-Industrial's
`Universal_Robots_ROS2_Description` project, licensed under BSD-3-Clause.

- `src/sorting_arm_description/urdf/ur5e/ur_macro.xacro`
- `src/sorting_arm_description/urdf/ur5e/inc/ur_common.xacro`
- `src/sorting_arm_description/urdf/ur5e/inc/ur_transmissions.xacro`
- `src/sorting_arm_description/meshes/ur5e/visual/*.dae` (base, shoulder, upperarm,
  forearm, wrist1, wrist2, wrist3)
- `src/sorting_arm_description/meshes/ur5e/collision/*.stl` (same seven links)

`ur_macro.xacro` still carries its upstream header, crediting Ludovic Delval as the
author of the migration to YAML-based configuration, with contributions from Denis
Stogl, Lovro Ivanov, Felix Messmer, Kelsey Hawkins, Wim Meeussen, Shaun Edwards, Nadia
Hammoudeh Garcia, Dave Hershberger, G. vd. Hoorn, Philip Long, Dave Coleman, Miguel
Prada, Mathias Luedtke, Marcel Schnirring, Felix von Drigalski, Felix Exner, Jimmy Da
Silva, Ajit Krisshna N L, and Muhammad Asif Rana. Mesh file paths were changed to
resolve against `sorting_arm_description` instead of `ur_description`; the mesh
geometry itself is unmodified.

Joint limits in `src/sorting_arm_description/config/joint_limits.yaml` are sourced from
the Universal Robots e-Series User Manual for the UR5e, version 5.8, and from
`https://github.com/ros-industrial/universal_robot/issues/265`.

## Robotiq 2F-85 description

Copied from `robotiq_description`, licensed under BSD-3-Clause.

- `src/sorting_arm_description/urdf/robotiq_2f_85/robotiq_2f_85_macro.urdf.xacro`
- `src/sorting_arm_description/urdf/robotiq_2f_85/ur_to_robotiq_adapter.urdf.xacro`
- `src/sorting_arm_description/meshes/robotiq_2f_85/visual/2f_85/*.dae` (robotiq_base,
  left/right_knuckle, left/right_inner_knuckle, left/right_finger,
  left/right_finger_tip, ur_to_robotiq_adapter)
- `src/sorting_arm_description/meshes/robotiq_2f_85/collision/2f_85/*.stl` (same ten
  parts)

Mesh file paths were changed to resolve against `sorting_arm_description`, the same as
the UR5e meshes above. The xacro files carry no upstream author header to preserve.

